of All Hallow's Eve.

360
00:20:42.125 --> 00:20:45.166
That of the Sanderson Sisters.

361
00:20:48.083 --> 00:20:52.541
The Sanderson Sisters
were the most powerful coven

362
00:20:52.666 --> 00:20:53.875
