<font color="#FF9966"><i>♫  Come little children  ♫</i></font>

463
00:26:24.375 --> 00:26:28.583
<font color="#FF9966"><i>♫  I'll take thee away  ♫</i></font>

464
00:26:28.666 --> 00:26:32.333
<font color="#FF9966"><i>♫  Into a land of enchantment  ♫</i></font>

465
